                                "sense_id": "32cf91b6-7438-3d6b-a069-21bc74852f58",
                                "text": "The best known or most generally recognized instances of telacoustic phenomena are the \"raps\" alleged by Spiritualists to be of very frequent occurrence in their experience, and almost invariably ascribed by them to the direct agency of the spirits of deceased persons."
                            },
