                                "sense_id": "32cf91b6-7438-3d6b-a069-21bc74852f58",
                                "text": "The idrovamolan with its telescopic, telacoustic, and telemagnetic powers came to their assistance in this difficulty. By its help parents and proparents were able to bring the youths into the very presence of the loathed deceit without submitting them to the chance of contagion."
